    rdfs:comment "External `Feed`s require explicit Athlete consent at `/subscribe?source=<url>` before registering in authoritative `IStorage` (`feed:registry` / `feed:subscriptions`) or importing `Seed` chunks. Subscribed Feeds default to `index-only` (zero eager chunk download, with opt-in `Download for offline`), support automatic version-bump syncing vs. manual check-only updates on `/settings/sync` (reachable from `/notebooks` via L2 navigation on desktop and the mobile drawer), and purge unmodified Seed rows via accessible `EditorDialog` `Unsubscribe` / `Delete` confirmations without harming user-authored or session-pinned `Note`s." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-01/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-01/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-01/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-01/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-01/beat/Prove> .

